These icons are drawn by tools/make_images.py from two icon fonts:

- Material Symbols (Outlined) by Google, used under the Apache License 2.0 in LICENSE.
  https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
- live_tv, tv_guide and record are television-classic, television-guide and record-circle from the Material Design
  Icons community set by Pictogrammers, used under the Pictogrammers Free License in
  LICENSE-mdi (the icons themselves are Apache 2.0). https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/
- rec_pill's REC is drawn in Open Sans Bold, from Google Fonts, under the SIL Open Font License.
  https://github.com/googlefonts/opensans
